"program_narrative": "Program PORTREAD is a batch program that lists the portfolio master file. It opens the indexed PORTFOLIO-FILE (dynamic access) for input and reads it sequentially, record by record, until end of file. For each record read it increments a record counter and displays the record number, portfolio ID, account number, client name, status and total value. At the end it closes the file, displays the total number of records read, and passes WS-RETURN-CODE (8 if the file could not be opened, otherwise 0) back as the program return code. The only error condition handled is a failed file open.",
